---
import Landing from '../../layouts/Landing.astro';
---

<Landing title="Build Systems That Matter" description="BARK needs engineers, fabricators, and infrastructure builders. Real constraints, open-source tools, and work that lasts.">

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="relative min-h-screen flex items-end pb-20 overflow-hidden">
    <img src="/images/yungas/death-road.jpg" alt="Road carved through the Yungas mountains" width="1920" height="1277" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" />
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 via-black/40 to-black/20"></div>
    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-[900px] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-10 w-full">
      <span class="text-label text-accent reveal">Builders</span>
      <h1 class="text-display text-white mt-6 reveal" data-delay="100">
        Build Systems<br/>That Matter.
      </h1>
      <p class="text-body-lg text-white/70 mt-8 max-w-2xl reveal" data-delay="200">
        Solar arrays, greywater systems, mesh radios, fabrication labs. Real constraints
        at 1,750m in the Bolivian cloud forest. Open-source everything.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-6 reveal" data-delay="250">
        <span class="inline-block px-4 py-2 bg-white/10 border border-white/20 text-white/80 text-sm font-display tracking-wide rounded">
          Phase 0: Research. No land, no infrastructure, no team on-site yet. This is the planning stage.
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4 reveal" data-delay="300">
        <a href="/en/builders" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-7 py-4 bg-accent text-night font-display font-semibold text-sm tracking-wide rounded hover:bg-accent-light transition-colors">
          Full Builder Page
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"/></svg>
        </a>
        <a href="mailto:contact@pt32lab.org?subject=Builder%20inquiry" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-7 py-4 border border-white/30 text-white font-display text-sm tracking-wide rounded hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors">
          Talk to the Team
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What Gets Built -->
  <section class="section-gap px-6 lg:px-10">
    <div class="max-w-[1100px] mx-auto">
      <span class="text-label text-accent reveal">What Gets Built</span>
      <h2 class="text-headline text-bark-800 mt-4 mb-10 reveal" data-delay="100">Six systems. All open-source.</h2>
      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        {[
          { num: '01', name: 'Energy', desc: 'Solar arrays + micro-hydro + battery storage. Counter-cyclical design for cloud forest climate.' },
          { num: '02', name: 'Water', desc: 'Spring capture, multi-stage filtration, greywater recycling. Gravity-fed, no pumps needed.' },
          { num: '03', name: 'Communications', desc: 'Starlink backbone + LoRa mesh + HF radio. Works when cell towers don\'t.' },
          { num: '04', name: 'Fabrication', desc: '3D printing, CNC, Gingery foundry. Print replacement parts, don\'t order them.' },
          { num: '05', name: 'Processing', desc: 'Coffee roaster, cacao line, solar dehydrators, essential oil stills. Value stays local.' },
          { num: '06', name: 'Shelter', desc: 'Earthship-inspired construction with local materials. Bamboo, compressed earth, recycled tires.' },
        ].map(s => (
          <div class="feature-card hover-lift reveal" data-delay={String(parseInt(s.num) * 80)}>
            <span class="feature-number">{s.num}</span>
            <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-bark-800 text-lg mb-2">{s.name}</h3>
            <p class="text-bark-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">{s.desc}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Why Here -->
  <section class="bg-bark-900 py-20 px-6 lg:px-10">
    <div class="max-w-[900px] mx-auto text-center">
      <h2 class="text-headline text-bark-50 reveal">If it works here, it works anywhere.</h2>
      <p class="text-body-lg text-bark-400 mt-6 reveal" data-delay="100">
        1,750m altitude. 1,300mm annual rainfall. Landslide season. A single road to the nearest city.
        These aren't obstacles — they're the design brief. Every system built here is tested against
        real failure modes that most maker spaces never encounter.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="section-gap px-6 lg:px-10">
    <div class="max-w-[900px] mx-auto text-center">
      <h2 class="text-headline text-bark-800 reveal">What do you build?</h2>
      <p class="text-body-lg text-bark-500 mt-4 reveal" data-delay="100">
        Solar, water, permaculture, fabrication, mesh networking, firmware. On-site or remote.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 reveal" data-delay="200">
        <a href="mailto:contact@pt32lab.org?subject=Builder%20inquiry" class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 px-8 py-4 bg-accent text-night font-display font-semibold text-sm tracking-wide rounded hover:bg-accent-light transition-colors">
          Tell us what you build
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Landing>
